+## Rewrote the iteration plan against real enterprise benchmarks
+
+User asked for the plan to be benchmarked to real enterprise standards with
+explicit goals / final outcomes. Rewrote `docs/iteration-plan-rag-dialogue.md`
+(841 lines). Now leads with the end state, not the work items.
